[{"title":"入青潭口占 其二","author":"林占梅","text":"溪流千折转，云壑万重深。\n古寺穿危磴，孤村隐茂林。\n山幽无瘴气，地僻有滩音。\n偃息长松下，跏趺复鼓琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44813,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由观音山晚归，过栖云寺","author":"林占梅","text":"诘曲度芳陂，岩阿拾级迟。\n看山凭款段，倚树听流离。\n花气晴频送，岚光暝忽移。\n荼■能好客，数里尚追随。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44814,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"剑潭偶成","author":"林占梅","text":"携筇拾级向高坡，纵目情幽步不颇。\n群巘如飞争拱寺，澄潭虽满不兴波。\n林间樵径穿岩远，水上鱼家傍竹多。\n我爱系船当夏夜，清钟萦榻月浮波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44815,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"双溪醴泉窟晚兴","author":"林占梅","text":"薄暮快披襟，风蝉断续吟。\n树交阴涧冷，云拥晚山深。\n好月临幽壑，流泉响隔林。\n逍遥盘石坐，煮茗复鸣琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44816,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入内湖山","author":"林占梅","text":"乱流奔濑急，仄径入山多。\n榕老根盘涧，门低屋挂萝。\n夕阳明野树，晴翠袭岩阿。\n鴶鵴声何处，随风似咏歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44817,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"系船登石岩，烹茶晚眺","author":"林占梅","text":"绿树阴浓处处蝉，溪山如画晚晴天。\n烹茶趺坐西岩上，閒看遥村起暮烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44818,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登栖云岩，偶晤家琴樵茂才题壁","author":"林占梅","text":"舣棹寻幽到上方，故人邂逅永公房。\n蝉声时趁钟声远，书味应兼道味长。\n四壁风骚留草字，一区水石佔梅香。\n评茶坐话苔矶久，岩畔归云已夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44819,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艋川登眺","author":"林占梅","text":"溪流浩淼势争奔，狮象交牙锁海门。\n沃野辟成香稻界，群峰环护绿篁村。\n楼台傍岸闾阎壮，樯楫迷津贾客喧。\n别有幽栖山水趣，江南而外漫同论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44820,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭吟村弟","author":"林占梅","text":"骨肉凋残祚已衰，雁行中断更伤悲。\n九原相见方知父，一病难延为忌医。\n踽踽吾身嗟独在，茫茫天道苦无知。\n聪明福命兼原少，夭折翻嫌汝不痴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44821,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初晴过北势湖庄舟中偶成","author":"林占梅","text":"竛竮修竹俯双荆，几道流泉下涧鸣。\n暑雨乍晴虹未落，暝烟欲起日初平。\n劳形仕宦输栖隐，适趣溪山惬性情。\n自把纶竿歌款乃，布帆无恙晚风轻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44822,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自南港到鸡笼道中口号","author":"林占梅","text":"群峰势何奇，追随十馀里。\n回首及斜阳，始入昏霭里。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44823,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小住杨山人栖隐处题壁六首 其一","author":"林占梅","text":"长松无数护吟楼，一派涛声枕上幽。\n读罢「黄庭经」一卷，横琴再鼓「碧天秋」。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44824,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小住杨山人栖隐处题壁六首 其二","author":"林占梅","text":"雨后空山夜气清，如银月色远峰明。\n翛然久坐云根上，云里幽泉自在鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44825,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小住杨山人栖隐处题壁六首 其三","author":"林占梅","text":"藤床竹槛晚凉多，无数岚光四壁罗。\n坐爱午晴新梦觉，穿窗时有白云过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44826,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小住杨山人栖隐处题壁六首 其四","author":"林占梅","text":"成蹊瘦竹间寒梅，岩畔幽轩晚尚开。\n别有钟声清似水，竟随归鹤入林来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44827,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小住杨山人栖隐处题壁六首 其五","author":"林占梅","text":"抱膝长吟兴不违，山居尽日掩荆扉。\n焚香默作楞严课，几缕炉烟绕翠微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44828,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小住杨山人栖隐处题壁六首 其六","author":"林占梅","text":"盘根老树倚云烟，斗室浓阴欲暮天。\n一道寒流穿石出，品茶喜有自来泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44829,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"林占梅","text":"南征一剑久摩挲，杀贼曾经夜渡河。\n万灶烟青军旅壮，千村地白战场多。\n兵机秘密亲磨盾，狼焰消沉尽偃戈。\n太息编氓蹂躏甚，不堪此日又兴波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44830,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚过剑潭寺留题二首 其一","author":"林占梅","text":"烟水泛苍茫，澄秋夕照光。\n渔矶潭藓滑，樵担野花芳。\n扫榻延居士，鸣钟礼法王。\n禅关随喜处，缓步上高冈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44831,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚过剑潭寺留题二首 其二","author":"林占梅","text":"放眼骋吟情，吟情此际清。\n诗成凭竹枕，茗熟话松棚。\n鸟掠晴波远，蝉摧暮霭生。\n坐来群动息，新月树端明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44832,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题林山人草堂","author":"林占梅","text":"苍松翠柏尽成蹊，篱落周遭护碧栖。\n水底波摇潭鲤戏，山坳昼永竹鸡啼。\n小楼坐眺时扶槛，曲径行吟每杖藜。\n我爱溪前平野外，层峦如画白云低。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44833,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过北势内湖再访林山人题壁","author":"林占梅","text":"峰回流水转，径曲小村偏。\n松竹门庭外，山池几席前。\n高吟蝉和韵，罢钓鹭同眠。\n赏遍幽栖处，吟怀此渺然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44834,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水返脚庄雨后晚话","author":"林占梅","text":"俗冗经旬渐次除，溪山似画对幽居。\n号滩流水回潮后，撼树狂风骤雨初。\n林外乍晴斜照见，岩阿欲暝积云馀。\n晚来共话瓜棚下，汲井评茶兴自如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44835,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再题林山人斋壁","author":"林占梅","text":"石遏鸣流树压崖，冈田级级似梯阶。\n波纹净印秋光好，山气晴和日夕佳。\n十里烟霞遮古渡，一庭松菊绕幽斋。\n诗筒画本添新料，得趣时时自遣排。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44836,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由南港入暖暖庄口号","author":"林占梅","text":"瓦屋茅檐傍水滨，家家织竹自成邻。\n村童夹道随看马，野老攀舆笑款人。\n高下园田皆沃土，纡回溪涧自通津。\n乡风到处争延致，礼貌依然古处纯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44837,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暖暖山庄夜步","author":"林占梅","text":"历落芳藤棘作笆，护堤老木郁槎枒。\n滩头作响泉添韵，露脚闻香稻著花。\n隔水萤光疑鬼火，前林鸡唱有人家。\n半规残月苍凉甚，兴尽方知去路赊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44838,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚泊岭南，明朝拟过鸡笼","author":"林占梅","text":"晚泊苍崖旅思寥，邻舟有客和吹箫。\n林端兔影中秋月，岭下鸡声半夜潮。\n胜概却凭毫底写，闷怀长藉酒中消。\n来朝又跨征骖去，浩渺烟波第几桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44839,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泛舟鸡笼","author":"林占梅","text":"山势若罗城，茫然晚趣生。\n水天秋一色，风月夜全清。\n石乱层崖险，烟沉远屿平。\n沧波时极目，渔火半江明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44840,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金包里横冈远眺","author":"林占梅","text":"险峻金包路，篮舆不易跻。\n渔家看蚁聚，鸟道听猿啼。\n沙霁田沿岭，崖悬树隔溪。\n明朝石门去，诘曲入云迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44841,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金包里旅舍午霁偶成","author":"林占梅","text":"当户群峰好，溪南雨乍晴。\n岚光浮日影，林韵挟泉声。\n连陌禾登陇，低檐豆压棚。\n我来时八月，篱菊未含英。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44842,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金包里梦觉口号","author":"林占梅","text":"孤村深夜觉，辗转思无涯。\n撼枕涛声壮，穿棂月影斜。\n劳形因作客，不寝每思家。\n况值中秋后，林风似晓笳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44843,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由金包里过石门","author":"林占梅","text":"崱嶪嶕峣百怪呈，危途崭绝倍心惊。\n马从密筱穿云出，人向悬崖附葛行。\n匝地扬沙风料峭，漫天飞雨浪砰訇。\n摇鞭陡立峰峦上，俯首群山似阅兵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44844,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮止竹山山家","author":"林占梅","text":"蚕丛回转处，曲折度荆笆。\n马辟云中路，人居树杪家。\n樵斤深谷集，水碓乱流哗。\n暝色前山起，苍然绮暮霞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44845,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小坑道中","author":"林占梅","text":"历历吹烟起，逶迤近小村。\n千林苏宿露，一鸟噪朝暾。\n云为穿岩滞，泉因下笕奔。\n晓炊丛竹里，隐约露柴门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44846,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后石门道中","author":"林占梅","text":"时雨川原遍，岩扃日未昏。\n湿云填断壑，杂树隐孤村。\n径为随田曲，泉因漱石喧。\n几家山坞里，修竹护低垣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44847,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由石门过圭柔山道中口号","author":"林占梅","text":"历过峰峦又水濆，冈田万顷一溪分。\n几多黄鸟栖红树，无数青山隐白云。\n诗思剧怜秋色晚，客途常怯夕阳曛。\n马蹄踏遍嵚?路，林外西风牧笛闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44848,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石门道中遇雨，舆中闷卧口占","author":"林占梅","text":"危途泥滑滑，仆马欲消魂。\n雾重埋山市，涛狂撼石门。\n溪桥经雨断，岭树受风喧。\n彷佛闻鸡犬，欣然已近村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44849,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过阿里旁有感","author":"林占梅","text":"鸟道盘危磴，蜗居聚小庄。\n褊衷常忐忑，举步遍礌硠。\n仆马连朝困，家园数月荒。\n何时超坎壈，观景惬诗肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44850,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"连日为风雨所困，留宿圭柔山田家，□以遣闷","author":"林占梅","text":"魂梦频惊动地雷，争奔万马竞喧豗。\n崩崖骇浪乘潮至，撼屋狂风挟雨来。\n水漫溪渠流更急，云封林壑闭难开。\n连朝闷卧茅斋下，一卷新诗手腹裁。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44851,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大屯顶登眺","author":"林占梅","text":"飘渺雄观一望收，遥遥岛屿浪中浮。\n看山兴适行无定，困雨心烦醉即休。\n云影日移岩穴暝，涛声夜吼海门秋。\n从今诗骨添雄健，胜卧元龙百尺楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44852,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻曾涤生大师克复江宁，诸贼歼戮殆尽，不觉狂喜","author":"林占梅","text":"海天遥处日频瞻，喜信闻来叶梦占。\n白下舆图归治化，红头仇寇尽除歼。\n十年壮志冰霜励，百世勋名竹帛添。\n我愿随鞭凭遣策，瞻韩何日向帷幨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44853,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江宁克复，曾涤生先生功绩伟甚。敬赋二律，以志欣仰 其一","author":"林占梅","text":"石头城阙下，又见出降旗。\n巢破林鸮殒，坛焚社鼠悲。\n跳梁终胆折，读檄足心夷。\n会待昌黎笔，重吟警惕诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44854,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江宁克复，曾涤生先生功绩伟甚。敬赋二律，以志欣仰 其二","author":"林占梅","text":"圣世绥屏障，臣穷励雪冰。\n回天资大力，指日见中兴。\n野寇黄巾尽，元戎白旆称。\n从兹安堵卧，击壤看丰登。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44855,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重登大屯山暮望","author":"林占梅","text":"蜡屐寻幽未觉劳，几回暮望向东皋。\n悬崖砌石盘云栈，断涧通流架木槽。\n林外夕阳归牧笛，山中空翠落吟袍。\n回途领略溪村景，谡谡松风似晚涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44856,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"步家薇臣「归赴秋闱」原韵送行","author":"林占梅","text":"乘风指日返仙乡，炯炯文星百丈光。\n折桂定跻蓬苑选，看花讵把小园忘。\n翀霄力大雕方健，缓辔吟閒马不忙。\n会见掇科如拾芥，功名事业两难量。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44857,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三角涌山庄晚眺","author":"林占梅","text":"戍楼络绎似连营，入谷樵歌邪许声。\n涧水倒悬林杪下，山云斜掠市檐行。\n岩巅落木秋容瘦，溪上层峦夕照明。\n独踞胡床空翠里，双峰如揖更生情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44858,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"温陵故友翁汝哲茂才物化数载，其嗣君克刚抵艋见访，盘桓旬日赴彰春试，握手依依，口号送之","author":"林占梅","text":"具有凌云志，相期岂一衿。\n佳音频洗耳，制课望关心。\n学羡三冬足，交论两世深。\n临歧重握手，惆怅漫成吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44859,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题熊霭堂明府「烹茗赏菊图」小照","author":"林占梅","text":"我慕栗里翁，东篱自怡悦。\n莫道淡逸嗜秋容，吾人由来重晚节。\n我希玉川子，龙团手自烹。\n浮乳数碗尘虑脱，习习清风两腋生。\n坡前丛菊盏中茶，柳边花底时放衙。\n海上宦游乔与梓，棠阴垂处可为家。\n当日诚君维我早，相看裙屐欣同好。\n流光转瞬曾几时，两鬓霜华各苍老。\n感君至性方闵、曾，养志承欢登寿考。\n海上羁留返棹难，家园远阻三千道。\n作图明志淡而真，琴鹤居官岂潦草。\n我展兹图已憬然，知君一邱常在抱。\n虽然画里非家园，如此高风岂易造。\n我家有园同画图，习池牛石殷花俱。\n叹我年来事驰驱，笠屐未遑留须臾。\n矧今即欲飞双凫，重负风月堪嗟吁。\n览君此图心顿输，嗜癖尤欣还不殊。\n衣冠桎梏非吾徒，何如脱簪散发相追呼。\n异时勇退东篱下，与君坐对南山品茗评花兴不孤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44860,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艋川书叹 其一","author":"林占梅","text":"古道谁云今尚留，乡闾时抱杞人忧。\n平生意气吞湖海，此日奔驰叹马牛。\n尽觉世情如纸薄，肯将时事等云浮。\n从兹敢鄙王戎吝，和峤应推第一流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44861,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艋川书叹 其二","author":"林占梅","text":"家计时艰两未平，劳薪尽日事非轻。\n蚍蜉撼树庸何怪，鬼蜮含沙亦足惊。\n忍把货泉填欲壑，遂教乐土变愁城。\n归来默默蒲团坐，魔障于今愿不生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44862,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"往观音山祭扫，小憩佃人家","author":"林占梅","text":"篮舆随径曲，四顾爱晴妍。\n吠犬喧村舍，飞禽集墓田。\n岩阿穿汲井，竹杪散炊烟。\n偃蹇茅堂下，清哦意洒然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44863,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二月二十四日游登栖云岩、观音山诸胜","author":"林占梅","text":"依旧閒情物外心，除将静养辄登临。\n石羁涧水潺湲下，径入岩松婉转深。\n无数白云眠永昼，几多黄鸟闹春阴。\n山亭小憩欣烹茗，又自携筇上远岑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44864,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏金银山","author":"林占梅","text":"长挂柴门短络篱，生成活计藉扶持。\n记名何事黄兼白，富贵骄人更可嗤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44865,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读卓人孝廉「逐疫行」，走笔率成绝句 其一","author":"林占梅","text":"嗷嗷到处听哀鸿，鹃血今尤匝地红。\n召伯不来屠伯至，欲教浩劫遍瀛东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44866,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读卓人孝廉「逐疫行」，走笔率成绝句 其二","author":"林占梅","text":"鼓吹声高独喜闻，朝朝挖眼复抽筋。\n最伤炮烙过钳网，入瓮何时请此君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44867,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读卓人孝廉「逐疫行」，走笔率成绝句 其三","author":"林占梅","text":"人命庭前等草菅，可怜十室九沉瘝。\n果然一笑方包老，不是朱提不解颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44868,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读卓人孝廉「逐疫行」，走笔率成绝句 其四","author":"林占梅","text":"太息睚眦并餮饕，择肥而噬岂能逃。\n伤心最是行途者，胸次难平拟续骚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44869,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读卓人孝廉「逐疫行」，走笔率成绝句 其五","author":"林占梅","text":"鬼才说鬼恰相宜，走出仙才腕更奇。\n一树诗歌千变化，奸邪妖魅各支离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44870,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读卓人孝廉「逐疫行」，走笔率成绝句 其六","author":"林占梅","text":"自古灾祥感召多，蝗飞入境虎过河。\n酿成厉气将何遣，逐疫还祈大吏傩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44871,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与家卓人考廉论诗","author":"林占梅","text":"生平趣向正无偏，使典驱坟出自然。\n遣兴不分唐、宋格，耽吟常见性灵篇。\n呕肝莫漫追长吉，得手何须托惠连。\n脱去浮词医尽俗，红尘关过始成仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44872,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后郊前晚归 其一","author":"林占梅","text":"沟渠㵐㵐遍鸣流，霭霭烟郊雨气收。\n斜照忽明云散尽，长虹犹挂碧山头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44873,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后郊前晚归 其二","author":"林占梅","text":"渡头芳草长萋迷，回首云山在隔溪。\n夹岸修篁归道好，斑鸠啼罢蟪蛄啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44874,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾保举多有遗议，作诗劝勉之","author":"林占梅","text":"将略尝推细柳营，纯臣郭令至今称。\n瘦羊博士廉犹让，大树将军广且平。\n谦退由来皆叶吉，骄矜自古鲜完名。\n不须击柱频挥剑，碑口传流有定评。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44875,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题黄香铁先生「苜蓿集」卷后","author":"林占梅","text":"迢迢东海外，一晤总为难。\n远信经年达，佳章尽日观。\n宛如闻声欬，不禁泪汎澜。\n回忆居京邸，蒙公刮目看。\n姻谊方卢、李，交亲等弟兄。\n于今殷问讯，在昔已知名。\n投辖贻三雅，传薪执一经。\n何时聆玉屑，顿使鄙怀清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44876,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读吴修轩上舍诗集，题词二首 其一","author":"林占梅","text":"渊然学问古为徒，岂藉申、韩作远图。\n命笔每开生面目，论文曾下死工夫。\n书真元凯耽同癖，画爱云林笑并迂。\n角逐名场身欲老，照人肝胆近今无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44877,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]